  "details": "There will be a huge player base that will be cut off from the vr chat communty without the use of mods. I know you will be bombarded today but at the very least have a plan to make sure your game stays accessible to everyone .\n1. Subtitles\n2. Text to speech \n3. Speech to text \n4. Voice filtering ( mod that allows you to hear voices closest to you for those with auditory processing issues )\nBonus: Dont cut off shadow: to give access to pc vrchat for those who do not have pcs \nImplemented and talk to the moding community who have created these mods. This game is built on the back of its user base and THEIR creations . Don't take this away . \nSo Before rolling this large security update out. Please consider taking your time to make sure its accessible for everyone . Please Think of people who will now lose access to their friend and connections without these mods. They will be losing access to the game . \nVrc was just featured on HBO including the deaf communty. Showing the world the good vrc can provide when giving people access to making connections. Please continue to support your disabled users as well as your able bodied users. \nThank you",
